Why would the player even go to the top Sokoban level? Many players
only want one specific sokoprize and turn around when they see that it
isn't the right one. If a sokobones provides them with the one they
want they can turn around *before* possibly even seeing the last
Sokoban level.

OTOH they could be greedy and might want to get the other prize, too.

With this in mind, it could very well be the case that the Sokoban
solution ratio wouldn't be different from Vanilla.

